{"id":"n31663-1-17","stage":1,"title":"검은색 · 黑","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31663-1-17-1","ko":"어머니, 머리에 새치가 많이 나셨네요.","zh":"妈妈，您长了好多白头发。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리에","audio":"/audio/706e62328b1459269ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"새치가","meaning":"少白发","explanation":"새치：少白发；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"새치","audio":"/audio/c275dbc856d83554ef32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63376","senseId":"1","lemma":"새치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새치가","audio":"/audio/b17a1ce027ac253fca98.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"나셨네요.","meaning":"长出，发，生","explanation":"나다：长出，发，生；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나셨네요","audio":"/audio/81368029a4687d907358.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"c275dbc856d83554","term":"새치","zh":"少白发","audio":"/audio/c275dbc856d83554ef32.mp3","entryId":"63376","definition":"年轻人的黑发中夹杂着的少量白头发。","pronunciation":["새ː치"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"长出，发，生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"冒出皮肤表层或地面。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/59610e0a24c6c2b613ba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31663-1-17-2","ko":"그렇구나. 검은색으로 염색을 해야겠다.","zh":"是啊，得染黑了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇구나.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇구나","audio":"/audio/80161bf1aea81e729eb5.mp3"}},{"text":"검은색으로","meaning":"黑，黑色","explanation":"검은색：黑，黑色；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"검은색","audio":"/audio/efd2ae43a0cf5f1a04eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31663","senseId":"1","lemma":"검은색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검은색으로","audio":"/audio/154c2ac4353899ec63d8.mp3"}},{"text":"염색을","meaning":"染色","explanation":"염색：染色；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"염색","audio":"/audio/9ea29c460c3fc8a315a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67635","senseId":"1","lemma":"염색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"염색을","audio":"/audio/9b360f5e2980f9e16904.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠다.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠다","audio":"/audio/85b0f5626748f3e821af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"efd2ae43a0cf5f1a","term":"검은색","zh":"黑，黑色","audio":"/audio/efd2ae43a0cf5f1a04eb.mp3","entryId":"31663","definition":"和没有光的夜空一样非常暗而深的色。","pronunciation":["거믄색"]},{"id":"9ea29c460c3fc8a3","term":"염색","zh":"染色","audio":"/audio/9ea29c460c3fc8a315a8.mp3","entryId":"67635","definition":"在布料、线、头发等上染上颜色。","pronunciation":["염ː색"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3c33f95d5ee62c39172.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.551,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31663","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2763,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，您长了好多白头发。","是啊，得染黑了。","我为什么总是越来越胖呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，您长了好多白头发。","是啊，得染黑了。","我为什么总是越来越胖呢？"],"answer":1}]}
